# f5-backup

Back up F5 BIG-IP configs (UCS) and commit them to git. Run as a cronjob.

## Setup

```bash
uv sync
```

Place the SSH private key at `key_files/f5backup` (git-ignored). Edit
`f5backup.conf` for hosts and `backup_dir`; passwords come from
`API_PASSWD_PROD` / `API_PASSWD_DEV` / `API_PASSWD_BENCH` or the conf defaults.

## Usage

```bash
uv run f5backup.py            # save + download + push
uv run f5backup.py save       # only create the UCS on the F5s
uv run f5backup.py download   # only download
uv run f5backup.py push       # only git commit + push
```

`./f5backup` is a cron wrapper for the default (all) command.

## Test

```bash
uv run pytest
```
